    <briefdescription>
<para>Wraps state for a lookup-in-progress. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>DefinitionGenerators can optionally take ownership of a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_lookup_state" kindref="compound">LookupState</ref> object to suspend a lookup-in-progress while they search for definitions. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
